sub:assertion {
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/thompson1917-ch12-05> delphi:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch12-05--grok> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch12-05--grok> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 on thompson1917-ch12-05: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.65" ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0> ;
    delphi:assessmentType "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0" ;
    delphi:hasScore "0.649"^^xsd:double ;
    delphi:hasVerdict "partially-resolvable" ;
    delphi:hasConfidence "0.58"^^xsd:double ;
    dct:description "The numerical target is unambiguous, so a handful of well-oriented sections could confirm or refute it. What is openly downloadable is an ontogenetic landmark set for related fusulinid genera, which can test whether expansion ratios near 1.5 are typical of that family but cannot substitute for Fusulina cylindrica and F. böcki. Discriminating power is high once those specimens are measured; assembling them is the limiting step." ;
    rdfs:comment "Proposed test with existing data: Measure successive whorl breadths on oriented thin sections of Fusulina cylindrica and Fusulina böcki and convert a constant breadth ratio to a spiral angle. The claim is confirmed if the ratio clusters near 1.5 and the angle near 86° across whorls and specimens; a ratio that drifts with whorl number, or a mean far from 1.5, would refute the stated figures." ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast> ;
    delphi:evidenceAgainst "The open coordinate file does not contain the two named Fusulina species.", "Published measurements of those species are scattered in monographs and would have to be redigitized from plates." ;
    delphi:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/thompson1917-ch12-05--grok--dataset-1> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch12-05--grok--operationalizability> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Operationalizability of thompson1917-ch12-05 by Grok 4.7: 0.92" ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0-operationalizability> ;
    delphi:assessmentType "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0/operationalizability" ;
    delphi:hasScore "0.92"^^xsd:double ;
    dct:isPartOf <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch12-05--grok> ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/thompson1917-ch12-05> delphi:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch12-05--grok--operationalizability> .
